  CVE-2026-40687|2026-04-30T22:16:25.923|2026-05-01T19:17:51.200|4.8|MEDIUM|CWE-909|N/A|false|In Exim before 4.99.2, when the SPA authentication driver is used with an adversarial SPA resource, there can be an out-of-bounds write that crashes the connection instance, or erroneous data processing that divulges data from uninitialized heap memory.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-40687|0.00065|0.19869|3.3619
