  CVE-2026-40742|2026-04-15T11:16:36.293|2026-04-29T10:17:45.187|5.3|MEDIUM|CWE-862|N/A|false|Missing Authorization vulnerability in Nelio Software Nelio AB Testing nelio-ab-testing allows Exploiting Incorrectly Configured Access Control Security Levels.This issue affects Nelio AB Testing: from n/a through <= 8.2.8.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-40742|0.00037|0.10890|3.7111
