  CVE-2026-36938|2026-04-13T16:16:30.033|2026-04-17T15:28:29.690|2.7|LOW|CWE-89|N/A|false|Sourcecodester Online Resort Management System v1.0 is vulnerable to SQL injection in /orms/admin/rooms/view_room.php.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-36938|0.00028|0.07861|1.8908
