  CVE-2025-50648|2026-04-08T19:24:15.570|2026-04-22T16:16:49.480|7.5|HIGH|CWE-120|N/A|false|A buffer overflow vulnerability exists in D-Link DI-8003 16.07.26A1 due to inadequate input validation in the /tggl.asp endpoint.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-50648|0.00048|0.14642|5.2514
