  CVE-2026-39473|2026-04-08T09:16:22.110|2026-04-24T18:08:35.440|5.3|MEDIUM|CWE-201|N/A|false|Insertion of Sensitive Information Into Sent Data vulnerability in Pär Thernström Simple History simple-history allows Retrieve Embedded Sensitive Data.This issue affects Simple History: from n/a through <= 5.24.0.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-39473|0.00036|0.10620|3.7111
