  CVE-2026-31351|2026-04-06T16:16:32.917|2026-04-07T21:14:30.467|4.8|MEDIUM|CWE-79|N/A|false|An authenticated stored cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability in the creation/editing module of Feehi CMS v2.1.1 allows attackers to execute arbitrary web scripts or HTML via injecting a crafted payload into the Title parameter.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-31351|0.00030|0.08365|3.3609
